A functional/explicit type conversion from a reference-typed operand
(`T(static_cast<A&&>(a))`, the std::forward construction form) must apply the
usual reference-binding / lvalue-to-rvalue conversion to the operand before
the cast ([expr.type.conv], [conv.lval]).
